        "Description": "Our intellegence gathered from previous contracts has revealed one of the leaders of international terrorist group &quot;Ragazzi Cattivi&quot;. Formally, he is known as &quot;Vaquero&quot;, but his real name is Hugo Sieger. From a secretive night club in Berlin he runs operations for the organiztion with help from his cousin, Theresa Rose, and his master hacker, Conrad Berg. Eliminate all three and exfiltrate. Care to dance 47?",
